      "story_intro": "秋席上那枚没说完话的冬之果核，在初雪夜裂开了：冻溪的守灵用雪链锁住果园的双径，向四季讨还最后一场较量——不是复仇，是确认：当万物收藏，村庄的灯还亮不建议。艾吉把春夏秋三季的灯串上了雪链。",
      "story_intro_en": "On the first snowy night the winter stone left on the autumn banquet cracked open: the frozen-creek warden chained the orchard's two lanes with snow, asking the four seasons to settle one last account — not vengeance, but a check: when all things rest, do the village lamps still burn? Eggy strung the lamps of three seasons onto the chains.",
      "story_outro": "雪链一节节自己解开，冻溪重新歌唱。守灵只留下一句话：极光的水晶阶，正为亮着的眼睛一级级结霜。",
      "story_outro_en": "Link by link the chains undid themselves and the frozen creek began to sing again. The warden left one line only: the aurora's crystal stair is frosting, step by step, for eyes that stay lit."
    },
