      "story_intro": "极光守灵把冬考挂在天上：三道光帘结成一阶一阶的水晶楼梯，召唤者领登、护盾者压阶——若蛋下的灯在光里断一次亮，光就为村庄熄一整冬。艾吉仰头看完三径，把塔排成了拾级而上的样子。",
      "story_intro_en": "The aurora warden hung winter's exam in the sky: three veils of light knitted into a stair of crystal, summons leading each step, shields bracing it from behind — let the lamp under the egg falter once in the glow, and the light goes out for the village the whole winter through. Eggy craned up to read all three roads, then filed the towers like ascending steps.",
      "story_outro": "光帘收成一匹白，铺进下一个无光的夜里。晶阶消融前最后闪了一下，像在指炉火的方向。",
      "story_outro_en": "The veils folded into one white sheet and slipped into the next lightless night. Before the crystal stair melted, it flashed once more, pointing toward the hearth."
