          "interval": 1.5,
          "delay": 56.0,
          "hpMul": 1.7,
          "speedMul": 1.0
        }
      ],
      "story_intro": "冬之守灵没有军队，只有一灶将熄的炉火和两条吹不透的长廓：它把最后的寒流编成队列，试的不是塔的火力，而是村庄肯不肯为别人留火——守得住这炉余温，长夜便不再设考。",
      "story_intro_en": "The winter warden keeps no army — only a hearth about to gutter and two galleries no wind can pass. It drilled the last cold wave into ranks; the test is not the towers' firepower but whether a village will keep a fire lit for someone else. Guard this ember through the night, and the long dark sets no more exams.",
      "story_outro": "炉火在天亮前重新站稳。守灵把寒流的令旗投进火里，化作第一朵庭雪：去庭院吧，最后的题在雪下等着。",
      "story_outro_en": "Before dawn the hearth stood steady again. The warden tossed its cold-command pennant into the flame, where it bloomed into the first garden snowflake: go to the yard — the last question waits beneath the snow."
    },
