      "story_intro": "庭雪落满灯罩的夜里，墨影守灵从三径同时渗进来：它不进攻，只吞光——吞一盏，冬就深一寸。要赢它不需要炮火更猛，只需要每盏灯后面都站着一个不肯睡的人。艾吉把全村的孩子都喊上了墙。",
      "story_intro_en": "On the night garden snow hooded every lamp, the ink-shadow warden seeped in along all three roads at once. It does not attack — it drinks light: swallow one lamp and the winter deepens one inch. To beat it takes not heavier cannon but one wakeful soul behind every flame. Eggy pressed every child in the village onto the walls.",
      "story_outro": "墨影在第三径的灯下退了潮——它怕的不是光，是守着光不睡的人。雪止，庭中只剩一盏灯还睁着：节至之灯。",
      "story_outro_en": "Under the lamps of the third road the ink-shadow tide retreated — what it feared was never light but the people who stayed awake to keep it. The snow stopped; one lamp alone still watched in the yard: the lamp of the solstice."
    },
