      ],
      "story_intro": "冬至之夜，四季之灵同环一盏灯：冻溪的链、极光的阶、炉火的余温与墨影的寒，各领一影踏上三径，只为问最后一个问题——春明年还会来，但若它失约一夜，村庄的灯还亮吗？三尊长夜之影各踏一径，灯芯摆在蛋边。",
      "story_intro_en": "On the solstice night the four seasons ringed a single lamp: the creek's chains, the aurora's stair, the hearth's last warmth and the ink-shadow's cold, each leading one shade down one of three roads to ask the final question — spring will come again, but if it ever fails a single night, will the village lamps still burn? Three shades of the long night, one per road; the wick laid beside the egg.",
      "story_outro": "长夜在三声鸡鸣里碎成霜花，灯芯自己引燃了第一个黎明。四季谢幕，各归其序——泉庭的井台上，新一年的晨露，已经悄悄结在了灯罩边缘。",
      "story_outro_en": "At the third crow of the cock the long night shattered into frost, and the wick set the first dawn alight itself. The four seasons took their bows and returned to order — and at the rim of the spring-yard lamp, this new year's morning dew had already gathered, in secret."
